<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<xmile version="1.0" level="3" xmlns="http://www.systemdynamics.org/XMILE" xmlns:isee="http://iseesystems.com/XMILE">
    <header>
        <smile version="1.0" namespace="std, isee">
            <uses_arrays>1</uses_arrays>
        </smile>
        <name>Lesson6MODELING</name>
        <uuid>b4fb21b5-1827-4b15-ac4b-0ef32a9f9108</uuid>
        <vendor>isee systems, inc.</vendor>
        <product version="10.1.2" isee:saved_by_v1="false" lang="en">iThink</product>
    </header>
    <style>
        <model font-family="Arial" font-size="12" />
        <interface font-family="Arial" font-size="9" />
    </style>
    <sim_specs method="Euler" time_units="Year" isee:pause_after_rates="false" isee:instantaneous_flows="false">
        <start>1</start>
        <stop>26</stop>
        <dt>1</dt>
    </sim_specs>
    <dimensions>
        <dim name="Dim_Name_1" size="1" />
    </dimensions>
    <model_units />
    <isee:prefs last_model="true" layer="model" grid_width="20" grid_height="50" divide_by_zero_alert="true" hide_taskbar="true" show_module_prefix="true">
        <isee:window width="853" height="612" />
        <isee:security />
        <isee:print_setup width="818" height="572" />
    </isee:prefs>
    <isee:equation_prefs order_by="module" />
    <model>
        <stock name="MY_SAVINGS">
            <doc>The number of $$ in MY SAVINGS to begin the simulation is defined by initial savings. &#x0D;</doc>
            <eqn>initial_savings</eqn>
            <inflow>Annual_Interest_Earned</inflow>
            <non_negative />
            <display x="429" y="789" color="blue" />
        </stock>
        <flow name="Annual_Interest\nEarned">
            <doc>This equation calculates annual interest by taking the number of dollars in MY SAVINGS and multiplying them by the annual interest fraction (that is the annual interest per cent x .01). An annual interest rate of 1%, for instance, then translates in 1/100th or .01 multiplied by MY SAVINGS. &#x0D;&#x0D;To change this equation, click on &quot;Hide Document,&quot; make desired changes and click OK.</doc>
            <eqn>MY_SAVINGS*Annual_Interest_rate_\_in_per_cent*.01 </eqn>
            <non_negative />
            <display x="330" y="787" color="black" label_side="top">
                <pts>
                    <pt x="253" y="787" />
                    <pt x="407" y="787" />
                </pts>
            </display>
        </flow>
        <aux name="Annual_Interest_rate_\\\nin_per_cent">
            <doc>This is the annual interest rate (as a per cent) paid on savings. A &quot;1&quot; indicates an annual interest rate of 1% or 1/100th (0.01) multiplied by the the amount of money in MY SAVINGS. Historical interest rates on Savings have run between 1 and 10 per cent. &#x0D;&#x0D;Type in a new number to change Annual Interest Rate (in per cent) and click OK.</doc>
            <eqn>1</eqn>
            <display x="248" y="836" color="fuchsia" />
        </aux>
        <stock name="TOTAL_INTEREST\nEARNED">
            <doc>This is the TOTAL (number of dollars of) INTEREST EARNED during the entire simulation. </doc>
            <eqn>0</eqn>
            <inflow>Annual_Interest</inflow>
            <non_negative />
            <display x="434" y="907" color="blue" />
        </stock>
        <flow name="Annual_Interest">
            <doc>This flow of Annual Interest Earned is used to define the Stock of TOTAL INTEREST EARNED during the simulation. </doc>
            <eqn>Annual_Interest_Earned</eqn>
            <non_negative />
            <display x="367" y="907" color="black">
                <pts>
                    <pt x="323" y="907" />
                    <pt x="412" y="907" />
                </pts>
            </display>
        </flow>
        <aux name="Year">
            <doc>This simply records the year of the simulation.</doc>
            <eqn>time </eqn>
            <display x="70" y="751" color="blue" />
        </aux>
        <aux name="initial_savings">
            <doc>This is the number of $$ of savings initially in MY SAVINGS.&#x0D;&#x0D;Type in a new number to change initial savings and click OK.</doc>
            <eqn>200</eqn>
            <display x="153" y="750" color="fuchsia" />
        </aux>
        <display page_width="818" page_height="572" page_cols="2" page_rows="3" isee:converter_size="medium" isee:name_only_modules="true" isee:animate_flows="true" isee:animate_stocks="true" interval="DT">
            <connector x="251" y="827" uid="0" color="black">
                <from>Annual_Interest_rate_\_in_per_cent</from>
                <to>Annual_Interest_Earned</to>
            </connector>
            <connector x="326" y="795" uid="1" color="black">
                <from>Annual_Interest_Earned</from>
                <to>Annual_Interest</to>
            </connector>
            <connector x="422" y="806" uid="2" color="black">
                <from>MY_SAVINGS</from>
                <to>Annual_Interest_Earned</to>
            </connector>
            <stacked_container height="260" width="454" uid="3">
                <graph type="time_series" title="Total number of $$ in MY SAVINGS" background="#FFFE91" show_grid="true" plot_numbers="true" isee:use_five_segments="true" hide_detail="true" comparative="true" cleared="true" time_precision="2" from="1" to="26">
                    <plot index="0" pen_width="3" color="blue" precision="1" show_y_axis="true">
                        <entity name="MY_SAVINGS" />
                    </plot>
                </graph>
            </stacked_container>
            <pad_icon x="652" y="767" width="26" height="22" color="#008F44" label_side="bottom" label="Graph 1" type="graph" icon_of="3" />
            <stacked_container height="270" width="475" uid="4">
                <table font-size="9" background="#E0E0E0" column_width="124" orientation="vertical" interval="1" cleared="true" date_time="2010-12-22T11:02:20Z">
                    <title>Untitled Table</title>
                    <item type="time" color="black" precision="max" width="47" />
                    <item color="black" precision="0.01" delimit_000s="true" index="0">
                        <entity name="MY_SAVINGS" />
                    </item>
                    <item color="black" precision="0.01" display_as="number" index="1">
                        <entity name="Annual_Interest_Earned" />
                    </item>
                    <item color="black" precision="0.01" delimit_000s="true" index="2">
                        <entity name="TOTAL_INTEREST_EARNED" />
                    </item>
                </table>
            </stacked_container>
            <pad_icon x="712" y="765" width="26" height="22" color="#008F44" label_side="bottom" label="Table 1" type="table" icon_of="4" />
            <numeric_display precision="0.01" display_as="currency" color="red" show_name="true" retain_ending_value="true" uid="5" x="675" y="672">
                <entity name="MY_SAVINGS" />
            </numeric_display>
            <button x="407" y="1084" width="146" height="31" uid="6" appearance="opaque" background="#E0E0E0" color="white" style="square" label="Explore Simple Stock and Flow Model" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <link target="model" x="0" y="588" />
            </button>
            <button x="398" y="518" width="146" height="31" uid="7" appearance="opaque" background="red" color="white" style="square" label="Explore Model Used in Lesson 6" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <link target="model" x="0" y="572" />
            </button>
            <button x="573" y="835" width="65" height="34" uid="8" appearance="opaque" background="#7F00FF" color="white" style="rounded" label="Run" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <menu_action>run</menu_action>
            </button>
            <button x="650" y="836" width="65" height="34" uid="9" appearance="opaque" background="#7F00FF" color="white" style="rounded" label="Reset" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <menu_action>restore_all</menu_action>
            </button>
            <numeric_display precision="1" delimit_000s="true" color="#FFFE91" show_name="true" retain_ending_value="true" uid="10" x="675" y="696">
                <entity name="Year" />
            </numeric_display>
            <button x="234" y="518" width="147" height="32" uid="11" appearance="opaque" background="#E0E0E0" color="white" style="square" label="Build Your Own Model " font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <link target="model" x="0" y="0" />
            </button>
            <text_box x="4" y="5" uid="12" color="red" font-family="Arial" font-size="32" font-weight="bold" text-align="center" padding="5" width="777" height="47">How Does Interest Grow My Savings? </text_box>
            <button x="243" y="1084" width="147" height="32" uid="13" appearance="opaque" background="red" color="white" style="square" label="Build Your Own Model " font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <link target="model" x="0" y="0" />
            </button>
            <button x="296" y="52" width="183" height="30" uid="14" appearance="opaque" background="#0CA0FF" color="white" style="rounded" label="Intro: Build Your Own Model!" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <popup x="-184" y="40" width="617" height="346" background="yellow" color="black">
                    <text_box font-family="Arial" font-size="16">If you haven&apos;t modeled before, watch our Build Your Own Personal Finance Model video to help you get started with using STELLA modeling software, available at http://clexchange.org/curriculum/dollarsandsense.asp. &#x0D;&#x0D;Choose from 2 options:&#x0D;&#x0D;(1) Use this blank STELLA page to build your own model from scratch. Everything you need is here (icons/buttons for building blocks, tables and graphs, text; Word menus to run and print...);  OR&#x0D;&#x0D;(2) Click on the &quot;Explore Model Used in Lesson 6&quot; to explore a version of the actual model used in Lesson 6 (it&apos;s a bit more complicated, but everything in it is explained!). &#x0D;&#x0D;Start wherever you want! Play with it and have fun!&#x0D;&#x0D;</text_box>
                </popup>
            </button>
            <text_box x="15" y="570" uid="15" color="red" font-family="Comic Sans MS" font-size="32" font-weight="bold" text-align="center" padding="5" width="746" height="56">Simple Stock/Flow Model (used in Lesson 6) </text_box>
            <button x="334" y="623" width="129" height="34" uid="16" appearance="opaque" background="#0CA0FF" color="white" style="rounded" label="What can I do with this?" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <popup x="-113" y="288" width="389" height="204" background="yellow" color="black">
                    <text_box font-family="Arial" font-size="16">Here&apos;s the Stock and Flow model used in Lesson 6. &quot;Annual Interest Earned&quot; is determined by the number of dollars in MY SAVINGS multiplied by the annual interest rate (or fraction) paid (For example, an interest rate paying 3% pays 0.03 multiplied by the amount in MY SAVINGS). &#x0D;&#x0D;Explore (e.g., change interest rates or initial savings; rename or add new building blocks to make this &quot;your&quot; model). Have Play with it and have fun!&#x0D;&#x0D;</text_box>
                </popup>
            </button>
            <style font-family="Arial" font-size="12" />
        </display>
        <interface show_pages="true" page_cols="3" page_rows="4" page_width="788" page_height="528" zoom="25">
            <simulation_delay>0</simulation_delay>
            <style font-family="Arial" font-size="9" />
        </interface>
        <popup x="502" y="501" visible="true" content="3" />
        <popup x="40" y="113" content="4" />
        <style font-family="Arial" font-size="12" />
    </model>
</xmile>
